        <activityName xml:lang="en">Photovoltaic laminate, micro-Si, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Photovoltaic laminate, micro-Si, at plant
Characteristics of the module: area: 1.4m2, expected lifespan: 30 years, capacity: 100Wp, efficiency 10%;
UUID: 7b0c0941-32ee-3cb3-bd69-197e5b5f6e1d
This dataset includes the most important materials, energy flows and emissions of the manufacturing of one square meter thin-film module in Oerlikon Solar"s "ThinFab". Furthermore it includes the infrastructure of the facility and the transport of the materials.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Micro-Si PV module.
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Planning data provided by Oerlikon Solar 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_7b0c0941-32ee-3cb3-bd69-197e5b5f6e1d.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
